  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760363,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1Xtreme (PlayStation) - Description\n\nExperience the adrenaline rush of ESPN Extreme Games, now re-released as 1Xtreme! This high-octane racing game plunges you into a world of extreme sports, featuring skateboarding, rollerblading, street luge, and mountain biking. Race through diverse and treacherous tracks spanning iconic locations like San Francisco, Lake Tahoe, and the jungles of South America. \n\nCompete for cash and dominance by kicking and punching your rivals off the course – no holds barred!  The game boasts four difficulty levels, ranging from beginner to EXTREME, ensuring a challenge for all skill levels.  Challenge a friend to split-screen multiplayer action and battle for supremacy. \n\nOriginally released in 1995, 1Xtreme was later re-released under the \"Greatest Hits\" line, removing ESPN branding due to licensing expiration.  Relive the excitement of the original, and prepare for a thrilling ride!"
    },
